7653 6.71368 3.77588 6.47088C3.67523 6.22808 3.62343 5.96783 3.62343 5.705C3.62343 5.44217 3.67523 5.18192 3.77588 4.93912C3.87653 4.69632 4.02405 4.47575 4.21 4.29C4.39575 4.10405 4.61632 3.95653 4.85912 3.85588C5.10192 3.75523 5.36217 3.70343 5.625 3.70343C5.88783 3.70343 6.14808 3.75523 6.39088 3.85588C6.63368 3.87653 6.85425 4.02405 7.04 4.29L7.1 4.35C7.33568 4.58054 7.63502 4.73519 7.95941 4.794C8.28381 4.85282 8.61838 4.81312 8.92 4.68H9C9.29577 4.55324 9.54802 4.34276 9.72569 4.07447C9.90337 3.80618 9.99872 3.49179 10 3.17V3C10 2.46957 10.2107 1.96086 10.5858 1.58579C10.9609 1.21071 11.4696 1 12 1C12.5304 1 13.0391 1.21071 13.4142 1.58579C13.7893 1.96086 14 2.46957 14 3V3.09C14.0013 3.41179 14.0966 3.72618 14.2743 3.99447C14.452 4.26276 14.7042 4.47324 15 4.6C15.3016 4.73312 15.6362 4.77282 15.9606 4.714C16.285 4.65519 16.5843 4.50054 16.82 4.27L16.88 4.21C17.0657 4.02405 17.2863 3.87653 17.5291 3.77588C17.7719 3.67523 18.0322 3.62343 18.295 3.62343C18.5578 3.62343 18.8181 3.67523 19.0609 3.77588C19.3037 3.87653 19.5243 4.02405 19.71 4.21C19.896 4.39575 20.0435 4.61632 20.1441 4.85912C20.2448 5.10192 20.2966 5.36217 20.2966 5.625C20.2966 5.88783 20.2448 6.14808 20.1441 6.39088C20.0435 6.63368 19.896 6.85425 19.71 7.04L19.65 7.1C19.4195 7.33568 19.2648 7.63502 19.206 7.95941C19.1472 8.28381 19.1869 8.61838 19.32 8.92V9C19.4468 9.29577 19.6572 9.54802 19.9255 9.72569C20.1938 9.90337 20.5082 9.99872 20.83 10H21C21.5304 10 22.0391 10.2107 22.4142 10.5858C22.7893 10.9609 23 11.4696 23 12C23 12.5304 22.7893 13.0391 22.4142 13.4142C22.0391 13.7893 21.5304 14 21 14H20.91C20.5882 14.0013 20.2738 14.0966 20.0055 14.2743C19.7372 14.452 19.5268 14.7042 19.4 15Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="mb-0">Configuración del sistema</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p>Personaliza y configura el comportamiento general del sistema según las necesidades:</p>
                        <ul class="custom-list">
                            <li><strong>Parámetros generales:</strong> Configurar nombre, logo y datos de la aplicación</li>
                            <li><strong>Notificaciones:</strong> Gestionar alertas y comunicaciones automáticas</li>
                            <li><strong>Mantenimiento:</strong> Programar tareas de limpieza y optimización</li>
                            <li><strong>Integración:</strong> Configurar conexiones con servicios externos</li>
                            <li><strong>Respaldos:</strong> Programar copias de seguridad automáticas</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="contact-section">
                    <div class="card border-primary">
                        <div class="card-body text-center">
                            <div class="contact-icon mb-3">
                                <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                                    <path d="M22 12H18L15 21L9 3L6 12H2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="text-gradient">Estado del sistema</h4>
                            <p class="text-muted mb-4">Todos los servicios están funcionando correctamente. Última verificación hace 2 minutos.</p>
                            <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row gap-3 justify-content-center">
                                <button class="btn btn-primary">
                                    <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="me-2">
                                        <path d="M1 12S5 4 12 4S23 12 23 12S19 20 12 20S1 12 1 12Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
                                        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
                                    </svg>
                                    Verificar Sistema
                                </button>
                                <button class="btn btn-outline-primary" >
                                    <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="me-2">
                                        <path d="M14 2H6C4.89543 2 4 2.89543 4 4V20C4 21.1046 4.89543 22 6 22H18C19.1046 22 20 21.1046 20 20V8L14 2Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                                        <polyline points="14,2 14,8 20,8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                                    </svg>
                                    Ver Registros
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .privacy-header .privacy-icon {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 100px;
        height: 100px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
        border-radius: 50%;
        color: white;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .icon-circle {
        width: 40px;
        height: 40px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        color: white;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .custom-list {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
    }

        .custom-list li {
            padding: 0.5rem 0;
            padding-left: 2rem;
            position: relative;
        }

            .custom-list li::before {
                content: "✓";
                position: absolute;
                left: 0;
                top: 0.5rem;
                color: #667eea;
                font-weight: bold;
                width: 1.5rem;
                height: 1.5rem;
                background: rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.1);
                border-radius: 50%;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                font-size: 0.75rem;
            }

    .contact-section {
        margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    .contact-icon {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 80px;
        height: 80px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.1) 0%, rgba(118, 75, 162, 0.1) 100%);
        border-radius: 50%;
        color: #667eea;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }
</style>

